====== D-Link DNS-313 ======


{{ media:dlink:dns-313-large.jpg?200|D-Link DNS-313}}

The D-Link DNS-313 is a very vanilla NAS released by D-Link in October 2007 with TV-adverts and everything (see below YouTube video).


{{youtube>LqK2ENsYiAQ?medium}}


It is using the Gemini platform based on ARMv4 Faraday silicon design. New firmware was still being released in 2010. The source files are dated october 2013. It has the following features (see the [[https://dflund.se/~triad/krad/dlink-dns-313/dns_313_datasheet_en_uk.pdf|datasheet]] for details).

The stock firmware is by now very outdated and dangerous to use on any open network due to the number of accumulated security flaws in the software packages. The OpenWrt images are recommended for use of this device.


